&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingGainOnSalesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingLossOnSalesOfPropertyPlantAndEquipmentTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※３　固定資産売却損の内容は、次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="text-align:left;margin-left:30.1pt;"&gt;
